{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring Diamond Painting to Life in a Relaxing Creative Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of diamond painting in a calming digital environment. Choose from a variety of beautiful artworks in different sizes, and fill them with colorful dots to complete your masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools inspired by real diamond painting: slice the transparent cover layer with a knife, place dots with a peaker that can hold 1 to 10 pieces and rotate horizontally or vertically, and remove mistakes with a precision tweezer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between round or square-shaped dots and enjoy the tactile satisfaction of each placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of the craft or just looking for a relaxing way to unwind, this game captures the essence of real diamond painting in an intuitive and engaging way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906690?t=1755552294","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906690?t=1755552294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906690/78bd842d9c660dcaad6538c03453ed8860459164/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755552294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906690/78bd842d9c660dcaad6538c03453ed8860459164/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755552294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring Diamond Painting to Life in a Relaxing Creative Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of diamond painting in a calming digital environment. Choose from a variety of beautiful artworks in different sizes, and fill them with colorful dots to complete your masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools inspired by real diamond painting: slice the transparent cover layer with a knife, place dots with a peaker that can hold 1 to 10 pieces and rotate horizontally or vertically, and remove mistakes with a precision tweezer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between round or square-shaped dots and enjoy the tactile satisfaction of each placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of the craft or just looking for a relaxing way to unwind, this game captures the essence of real diamond painting in an intuitive and engaging way.</p>","developers":["LaiZna"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906690/a6f55e9d78946fed2745650585a4bf8c41883fb0/header.jpg?t=1755552294","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184076,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184076/movie480.mp4?t=1755552293","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184076/movie_max.mp4?t=1755552293"},"name":"play demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184076/6bda186c1b86f9d05cd896f483fd8d83668e1a87/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755552293","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184076/